Replace (C6-residue) by:

\[
\boxed{
\operatorname{res}\!\left(
\frac{L_M(\lambda)(\theta)}
{n(M)(\theta)}
\right)
=
\iota_\theta(\lambda).
}
\tag{C6-residue}
