In §2.6, replace

> After division by \(n(M)\), its residue is \(\lambda_r\eta^r\). Basis independence prevents cancellation and proves (C6-residue).

with:

> After evaluation at \(\theta\) and division by \(n(M)(\theta)\), the \(r\)-th summand has residue
